> tools
The tools of a forensic necromancer’s trade: a mirror, a packet of entheogens,
and a keychain with a little ball compass. Everything you need to divine
memories of the past.

Well, maybe the compass isn’t strictly necessary. But archaeologists lay
everything out by compass directions, so that one helps you find those memories
in the first place.

