id: 1778630448676
parent-id: 1778630448675
command: wake up
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> wake up
Returning to the real world is a bit like waking up from a lucid dream. Your
method isn’t the most dignified, but it is highly reliable—all you have to do is
hyperventilate. If your physical body mirrors it, even a little, it’ll shock you
awake.

So you pause, close your eyes, and start to force as much air out of your lungs
as you can in fast, sharp breaths. Soon your head starts to swim, and...

