command: n
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> n
You walk north through the front door.

[0m[1mZiggurat[0m
You’re standing on a wide platform halfway up a tower of towers: one massive
pillar stacked on another, on another, on another. The top vanishes into the
mists above and the ground is nothing but a distant blur. You’re left on the
walkway in between, canted at a steeper angle than is really comfortable.

All around, other memories have forced their way in like tree roots cracking
through a sidewalk. To the south, the walkway runs headlong into the front of a
mud-brick house, its <door> standing open; west, the steps down barely make it a
meter before they’re lost in a <blinding light>; east, a balcony cuts straight
through the side of the ziggurat. The whole tableau is frozen like a fly in
amber, with you in the middle of it all.

You see an <iron-tipped spear> here.

