[0m[1mWorkshop[0m
This room is not small: the ceiling is high and the floor wide. But the heat and
the smoke make it feel tight all the same, and you’re hemmed in on all sides by
<tools and equipment>. The scent of hot metal stings in your nose.

A towering <statue> dominates the room, light blazing from its gold-plated skin.
Its fiery gaze is fixed on the door to the east.

