command: gold
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
> gold
It stands tall and imperious, at least double your height, its skin plated with
finely-hammered gold and silver, its hair and beard set with lapis lazuli. It
must represent one of the gods, probably Marduk; a fiery glow radiates from its
face, filling the eastern passage with light.

It’s only once your eyes adjust that you can see the more mundane side: the
wooden scaffolding around it, the movable <work platform> underneath. This god
seems to be under construction.

